 movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The catalog of all components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" extensions and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModifiers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Components"}}}